{
  "id": "focus-new-browser-tab",
  "priority": "P1",
  "title": "Cmd+Shift+L from a terminal, a fresh split and a just-made split: the new tab's address bar takes the next key",
  "why": "Lawrence 2026-10-29 (felt 1f): 'i do cmd shift l and it opens a browser tab, but then i start typing, and nothing is focused'. The v2.2.7-opt gate's restart-focus-after-settings failed the same way: 15 s after Cmd+Shift+L the model still targeted the terminal. Keys go through the app's event queue (debug.key sequence) to the key window, as a keyboard's do; the probe key is read back from the address bar's field. The invariant: plans/cmux-next/focus-invariant.md.",
  "source": "felt queue 1f; dfo-evidence gate227 restart-focus-after-settings step 12",
  "budget_seconds": 120,
  "steps": [
    {"do": "new_terminal", "via": "key", "as": "left"},
    {"do": "neutral_prompt"},
    {"do": "type", "text": "echo fb-${nonce}-$((6*7))", "enter": true, "mark": "typed"},
    {"do": "focus_press", "key": "escape", "make_key": true},
    {"do": "focus_probe", "expect": "terminal"},
    {"do": "focus_press", "key": "l", "modifiers": ["cmd", "shift"], "mark": "browser1"},
    {"do": "rpc", "method": "debug.focus"},
    {"do": "focus_probe", "expect": "addressBar", "fail": false},
    {"do": "rpc", "method": "debug.omnibar"},
    {"do": "focus_press", "key": "d", "modifiers": ["cmd"], "mark": "split"},
    {"do": "focus_probe", "expect": "terminal", "fail": false},
    {"do": "focus_press", "key": "l", "modifiers": ["cmd", "shift"], "mark": "browser2"},
    {"do": "focus_probe", "expect": "addressBar", "fail": false},
    {"do": "focus_press", "key": "d", "modifiers": ["cmd"], "mark": "split2"},
    {"do": "wait", "seconds": 1.1},
    {"do": "focus_press", "key": "l", "modifiers": ["cmd", "shift"], "mark": "browser3"},
    {"do": "rpc", "method": "debug.focus"},
    {"do": "focus_probe", "expect": "addressBar", "fail": false},
    {"do": "key", "key": "d", "modifiers": ["cmd"], "mark": "split3"},
    {"do": "wait", "seconds": 1.1},
    {"do": "key", "key": "l", "modifiers": ["cmd", "shift"], "mark": "browser4"},
    {"do": "rpc", "method": "debug.focus"},
    {"do": "wait", "seconds": 3},
    {"do": "rpc", "method": "debug.focus"},
    {"do": "rpc", "method": "debug.desync", "params": {"check": true}},
    {"do": "use", "name": "left"},
    {"do": "expect", "title": "evidence the run was in this app: the first terminal's echo; the invariant holds at the end", "since": "typed", "timeout": 10,
     "all": [{"daemon_line": "fb-${nonce}-42"}, {"app_text_line": "fb-${nonce}-42"}, {"focus_ok": {}}, {"frame_text": "fb-${nonce}-42"}]}
  ]
}
